{% extends "@core/errors/base.p2" %}

{% block detail %}
<p>
  Something failed on the server. Nothing you did caused it, and nothing you
  typed is stored because of it.
</p>
<p>
  The reference below identifies this exact failure in the server's log. It is
  the fastest thing to include when reporting the problem, and it contains
  nothing useful to anyone who cannot read that log.
</p>
{% endblock %}
